      <h1 class="jr-h1">Blood Tests for Hair Fall: What to Check Before You Buy Supplements</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Most people buy a hair supplement before anyone has measured anything, which means the money is spent before the cause is known. Here are the five tests worth asking for, what the pooled evidence says each one is actually worth, and the one supplement that can distort your results.</p>

